      "writtenOn": "2020-12-02T01:04:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi! Was this prompted by a practical use case or just completeness? DSA is a legacy, deprecated key type, and we don\u0027t want to encourage its use. Also, it\u0027s not clear to me what system would support the OpenSSh key format but still require DSA.",
      "revId": "bc12630023706a10e3ab2cc46bb34f9f060f9cd7",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705"
    },
