      "writtenOn": "2020-12-04T16:36:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Understood, but this is not about using an old cipher, it\u0027s about intentionally using an old cipher along with a modern encoding which AFAIK has never been the default for that key type. These users must already know what they are doing.\n\nAbsent any data suggesting this is a common use case, we\u0027re not going to carry its complexity, sorry.\n\nMoreover, DSA is deprecated and it will be removed from all default surfaces: https://github.com/golang/go/issues/40337",
      "parentUuid": "6c6367d3_1d38166c",
